            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>In a board, among contact portions, some contact portions are disposed in a first region, the remaining contact portions are arranged in a second region. The some contact portions include a first contact portion, a second contact portion, a third contact portion, and a fourth contact portion. The remaining contact portions include a fifth contact portion. The some contact portions and the remaining contact portions are asymmetrically arranged with respect to a first virtual line.</p>
